/E (Fir jab user koi Video clip ko left side panel se drag kare to fir usmein 2 condition hogi, \(1\) Agar user drag sidha canvas par karega to canvas mein jab video drag ho raha hoga tab kuch canvas esa dikhna chahiye jese ki wo select ho wesa like jese wo guide kar raha hein ki wahi pe drop karo. ye effect tabhi dikhni chahiye jab clip canvas ke uper drag  baaki uske baha nahi dikhna chahiye. \(2\) Agar user sidha timeline par drag kare to timeline kuch esa hi sikhna chahiye jesa ki wo select ho. same jesa canvas mein wesa hi same timeline mein.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
